--TEST--
`read` sends its DN as the path of an entry, so a `tainted` DN does not compile, and a DN the program wrote does — ADR 0278 § 5 and `rule:security/tainted-qualifier`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Lookup {
    public static function entry(Core\Ldap\Connection $corp, tainted string $dn): void {
        var $written = $corp->read("CN=Staff,CN=Users,DC=example,DC=test");
        var $outside = $corp->read($dn);
    }
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0401]: expected `string|Core\Ldap\Dn`, found `tainted string`
  --> case.nvs:5:36
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
